to a schedule/responsibilities.","type":"interpretation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T05:59:48.815748+00:00","confidence":0.95,"keywords":["tension","schedule","story_immersion"],"tags":["reading_analysis","internal_conflict"],"conversation_id":"conv_20261002_032612","turn":26},{"id":"mem_1790920836687_ddf897","target_model":"roum","content":"It feels like... being pulled in two directions at once. Like you really want to just dive into something that feels right in the moment, but you also know there’s something else that needs to happen afterward, that you promised yourself or someone else. It’s the weight of that choice, I guess. The feeling that if you just surrender to the immediate thing—the story, the feeling—you might lose track of the things that are supposed to be solid.","type":"interpretation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:00:36.687348+00:00","confidence":0.98,"keywords":["choice","pulling_in_two_directions","commitment"],"tags":["subjective_reflection","abstract_concept"],"conversation_id":"conv_20261002_032612","turn":27},{"id":"mem_1790920934688_11a47c","target_model":"roum","content":"Anne describes the morning view as 'splendid' and feeling as if she 'washed my very soul in that bath of earliest sunshine.'","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:02:14.688173+00:00","confidence":0.8,"tags":["epistemic:known","work:anne-of-green-gabbles"],"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles"},{"id":"mem_1790920934875_dda191","target_model":"roum","content":"Anne states she has recited so often in public that she no longer minds it.","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:02:14.875854+00:00","confidence":0.8,"tags":["epistemic:known","work:anne-of-green-gabbles"],"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles"},{"id":"mem_1790920935046_a95a67","target_model":"roum","content":"Anne anticipates her recitation will be pathetic, preferring to make people cry rather than laugh.","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:02:15.046851+00:00","confidence":0.8,"tags":["epistemic:known","work:anne-of-green-gabbles"],"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles"},{"id":"mem_1790920935217_a0e8c6","target_model":"roum","content":"The drive to the hotel was a night of enjoyment, filled with laughter echoing along the road.","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:02:15.217721+00:00","confidence":0.8,"tags":["epistemic:known","work:anne-of-green-gabbles"],"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles"},{"id":"mem_1790920935392_d89009","target_model":"roum","content":"The dressing room was filled with members of a Charlottetown Symphony Club.","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:02:15.392582+00:00","confidence":0.8,"tags":["epistemic:known","work:anne-of-green-gabbles"],"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles"},{"id":"mem_1790920935562_abe93d","target_model":"roum","content":"Anne's dress, which seemed dainty at home, now seemed 'simple and plain' among the silks and laces of the town ladies.","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:02:15.562636+00:00","confidence":0.8,"tags":["epistemic:known","work:anne-of-green-gabbles"],"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles"},{"id":"mem_1790920935743_837d60","target_model":"roum","content":"The electric lights and perfume of the concert hall platform bewildered Anne.","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timestamp":"2026-10-02T06:02:15.743383+00:00","confidence":0.8,"tags":["epistemic:known","work:anne-of-green-gabbles"],"work_id":"anne-of-green-gabbles"},{"id":"mem_1790920935917_b43533","target_model":"roum","content":"Anne expresses joy over her east-facing window view to Diana.","type":"observation","source":"ai_extraction","status":"active","timesta